line	<str>Swamp tar</str>
line	<str>I should then take the disguises to Nickolaus in the cave.</str>
line	<col=000080>I got the fancy dress shop owner to make me an eagle disguise so that I could trick the eagles and get into their nest. I gave a disguise to <col=800000>Nickolaus</col> so that he could escape the nest. I still need to get him to <col=800000>capture a ferret</col> for the <col=800000>zookeeper</col>.</col>
