line	<str>I returned to the zoo and presented Charlie with a replacement for his lost ferret.</str>
line	<col=ff0000>QUEST COMPLETE!</col>
line	<col=000080>I was awarded <col=800000>2 Quest points</col> and <col=800000>2500 Hunter XP</col>. I also learnt how to capture <col=800000>ferrets</col>, which I can use when hunting <col=800000>rabbits</col>, and have access to the <col=800000>eagles</col> at the top of <col=800000>Eagles' Peak</col>.</col>
